    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#00008B;\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> guidelines. Whether or not it can be used is, as always, the prerogative of the Gamemaster.</b></i></td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>Homebrew Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Legacy_of_the_Force_Sourcebook\" title=\"Legacy of the Force Sourcebook\">Legacy of the Force Sourcebook</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Your ranged attacks are invariably lethal.</p><p><b>Prerequisites:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Deadeye\" title=\"Deadeye\">Deadeye</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +8</p><p><b>Effect:</b> If you succeed with a ranged attack roll after having <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aimed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Aimed\">Aimed</a>, you deal additional damage equal to one-half your Character Level.</p>",
